  - Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a36e02e33d79588092bc75c0b62d9571, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Start: 0.14
      End: 5.8224
      Chinese: "本台消息，受多方面因素影响，玩具工厂将暂时关闭。"
      English: "Local news. The toy factory will close temporarily for a number of reasons."
    - Start: 6.2226
      End: 12.5853
      Chinese: "厂方提醒，停止生产不代表所有设备停止运行。"
      English: "The company reminds staff that stopping production does not mean all machinery will stop running."
    - Start: 13.1056
      End: 19.4083
      Chinese: "部分自动系统仍将维持工作，直至最后一件产品离厂。"
      English: "Some automatic systems will remain in operation until the last product leaves the factory."
